sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    participant DS as Dark Store System
    participant P as Picker App
    participant DD as Dispatch System
    participant R as Rider App

    C->>OS: Place order
    OS->>IS: Reserve inventory
    IS-->>OS: Inventory reserved
    OS->>DS: Send order to dark store
    DS->>P: Assign order to picker
    P->>DS: Start picking
    P-->>DS: Finish picking (Order packed)

    DS->>DD: Order ready for dispatch
    DD->>R: Offer delivery task
    R-->>DD: Accept task
    R->>DS: Arrive at dark store & pickup

    loop Every few seconds
        R->>DD: Send GPS ping
        DD-->>C: Update live tracking
    end

    R->>C: Arrive at customer location
    R->>DD: Mark order delivered
    DD-->>OS: Update order status
    OS-->>C: Delivery complete notification
